  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET MVC PPTX Editor is a feature-rich UI component for viewing, navigating, presenting, printing, and exporting PowerPoint presentations (PPTX) directly in the browser without requiring Microsoft PowerPoint or server-side rendering services. It supports rich slide rendering with text, images, shapes, and tables; thumbnail and keyboard navigation; zoom and fit-to-window controls; slide virtualization for large presentations; full-screen slide shows and presenter view; speaker notes; browser printing; and PowerPoint (.pptx) export. The component provides an intuitive ribbon and status bar for read-only presentation viewing in ASP.NET MVC 5 applications.",
